	/**
	 * Companion System -- one-time baseline HAM migration (spec: "migrate
	 * the companion's stats as if they were a master entertainer", a
	 * one-time thing whenever a new companion is granted). Entertainer is a
	 * pure support profession with no combat stat_*_boost skill mods in the
	 * base game, so "as if master entertainer" reduces to a flat, non-combat
	 * baseline across all 9 HAM sub-attributes rather than any profession-
	 * specific bonus. Idempotent/safe to call more than once (e.g. if the
	 * player cancels the starter-profession SUI and it's re-shown on a
	 * later summon) -- see CompanionObjectImplementation.cpp for the actual
	 * baseline values and docs/companion_system/NOTES.md for the reasoning.
	 * @pre { this object is locked }
	 */
	@preLocked
	public native void migrateBaselineStats();
